        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>课文内容概要（11-15课）</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']]}\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #ffffff;\n  }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    line-height: 1.85;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 720px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    padding: 18px;\n  }\n  /* 红色装饰外框 */\n  .outer-border {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;\n    border: 14px solid #c8102e;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n  .inner-border {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 20px; left: 20px; right: 20px; bottom: 20px;\n    border: 1px dashed #e8a0a8;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n  .corner {\n    position: absolute;\n    width: 26px;\n    height: 26px;\n    color: #d4a017;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 26px;\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n  .corner.tl { top: 18px; left: 18px; }\n  .corner.tr { top: 18px; right: 18px; }\n  .corner.bl { bottom: 18px; left: 18px; }\n  .corner.br { bottom: 18px; right: 18px; }\n\n  .content {\n    position: relative;\n    padding: 26px 26px 26px 26px;\n  }\n  p {\n    margin: 0 0 2px 0;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .indent {\n    text-indent: 2em;\n  }\n  h2 {\n    font-size: 21px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 6px 0 2px 0;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n  .h-purple { color: #7b2fbe; }\n  .h-orange { color: #e8511a; }\n  .h-green  { color: #1f8a3c; }\n  .red { color: #d81e06; }\n  .red-u { color: #d81e06; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: #d81e06; }\n  .blue-u { color: #1f4fd8; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: #1f4fd8; }\n  .green { color: #1f8a3c; }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #bbb;\n    color: #888;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"outer-border\"></div>\n  <div class=\"inner-border\"></div>\n  <div class=\"corner tl\">❋</div>\n  <div class=\"corner tr\">❋</div>\n  <div class=\"corner bl\">❋</div>\n  <div class=\"corner br\">❋</div>\n\n  <div class=\"content\">\n\n    <p class=\"indent\">艾青的诗歌《绿》运用文字的魅力用文学的形式描述了<span class=\"red\">春天到处都是绿色</span>，树木大地中的小草在春风的春拂下来回摆动，<span class=\"red\">风是绿的，水是绿的，世界充满了绿</span>。绿是<span class=\"red\">生命</span>的颜色，是<span class=\"red-u\">生命</span><span class=\"red-u\">的象征</span>。</p>\n\n    <h2 class=\"h-purple\">11.白桦</h2>\n    <p class=\"indent\"><span class=\"green\">《白桦》</span>诗歌以白桦为中心意象，从不同角度描写它的美。白桦那么<span class=\"red-u\">高洁、挺拔</span>，它是<span class=\"blue-u\">高尚人格</span>的象征。</p>\n\n    <h2 class=\"h-purple\">12.在天晴了的时候</h2>\n    <p class=\"indent\"><span class=\"green\">《在天晴了的时候》</span>这是一首生动、活泼、情趣盎然的小诗，诗人以清新、优美的语言，运用<span class=\"red-u\">拟人</span>的手法、形象的比喻勾勒出一幅幅充满生机的画面，展现了<span class=\"red-u\">雨后天地间</span>的<span class=\"red-u\">亲切、自然、欢乐和美好</span>，抒发了<span class=\"blue-u\">亲近自然、热爱生活的情怀</span>。</p>\n\n    <h2 class=\"h-orange\">13.猫</h2>\n    <p class=\"indent\"><span class=\"green\">《猫》</span>一文是著名作家<span class=\"red-u\">老舍</span>的作品，作者通过对猫的<span class=\"blue-u\">古怪性格</span>和<span class=\"red-u\">满月小猫</span>特点的描写，抒发了对<span class=\"blue-u\">猫的喜爱之情</span>。</p>\n\n    <h2 class=\"h-orange\">14.母鸡</h2>\n    <p class=\"indent\"><span class=\"green\">《母鸡》</span>一文是<span class=\"red-u\">老舍</span>先生脍炙人口的佳作，描写了作者对母鸡的看法的变化，表达了作者对<span class=\"blue-u\">母鸡的赞颂之情</span>。课文<span class=\"red-u\">以作者的情感变化为线索</span>，前后形成了<span class=\"red-u\">鲜明</span>的对比。前半部分写了母鸡的<span class=\"red-u\">无病、欺软怕硬、拼命炫耀</span>，后半部分写了母鸡的<span class=\"red-u\">负责、慈爱、勇敢、辛苦</span>，塑造了一位\"<span class=\"blue-u\">伟大的鸡母亲</span>\"的形象。</p>\n\n    <h2 class=\"h-green\">15.白鹅</h2>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
